  {
    "id": "2026-10-27-bedtime",
    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-27T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "口水期的家長，請誠實回答。\n一天換幾條圍兜？留言報數字，最高的那位小鷹敬你一杯（水）。\n小鷹辦公室的紀錄是 7 條，還是同一個小孩。\n圍兜的款式怎麼挑，官網有整理：\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-bib-guide",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1027-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "3d3665ecf2196da4da4f7de7ffc5f1698f26ee4b549fdeec1196cea94ef4ce31",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
