  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-10-evening-owl-text-10",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-10T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "防風罩的三種固定，先分清楚再用。\n推車：用白夾扣或彈性束帶，固定在合適的位置。\n揹巾：沿肩帶扣住上緣，揹巾本身照樣承托。\n下擺：按釦扣成兩個褲管，再確認腿腳能活動，布料遠離輪子與關節；無論哪一種，都露出臉和口鼻，也不取代原有安全帶。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "published",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00",
    "run_id": "42820460529",
    "container_id": "17966102859228916",
    "published_id": "18083115968422426",
    "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@lovehibou/post/Dfj9n8NEfO5",
    "published_at": "2026-11-10T20:59:59+08:00",
    "error": null,
    "reply_id": "18090474101701825"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-11-noon-owl-ep02-s2",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-11T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "風大的日子，也想帶你慢慢走。\n不必趕路，也不用把小被子一路追著跑。\n先照推車或揹巾的說明扣上，不要拆掉原本的固定。\n路上看：臉露出來、口鼻沒被蓋住、扣子有沒有鬆。熱了就打開。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep02_s2.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-windshield?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "skipped",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00",
    "note": "missed window",
    "run_id": "43018129999"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-12-evening-owl-ep02-s3",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-12T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "從出門到回家，唸的都是這幾句。\n有沒有冷？會不會熱？臉有沒有露出來？\n口鼻別被布蓋住，安全帶照扣，下擺別靠近輪子和關節。\n存起來，下次出門再對一次。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep02_s3.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "published",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00",
    "run_id": "43225692853",
    "container_id": "17966430456228916",
    "published_id": "17866113015696477",
    "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@lovehibou/post/DfpJIFLiQR6",
    "published_at": "2026-11-12T21:17:01+08:00",
    "error": null,
    "reply_id": "17898839178612671"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-13-noon-owl-text-12",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-14T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "六重紗，不是越厚越好。\n看季節、室溫、怎麼用，也看孩子會不會出汗。\n「六重」是布料結構，不是保暖分數；別只數層數，厚薄和用途一起看。\n先選用得到的，再選花色。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-14-noon-owl-ep01-s1",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-14T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "風一吹，小被子又想溜走。\n一手推車、一手撿被子，還要看寶寶會不會著涼。\n把防風罩扣在推車上，布就不會一路被風帶走；臉和口鼻留在外面。\n你也有過一路追著小被子的時刻嗎？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep01_s1.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-15-evening-owl-ep01-s2",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-15T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "帶寶寶出門，天氣總有自己的想法。\n早上有風，午後也許又暖了起來；進到室內，還要再看看這一層需不需要。\n需要時再加上，覺得熱了就打開或取下，臉和口鼻隨時露出來。\n你今天也幫寶寶調整了幾次衣服？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep01_s2.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-windshield?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-16-bedtime-owl-ep01-s3",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-16T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "當爸媽之後，睡前多做這幾件。\n小手有沒有放好，房間會不會太熱。\n坐下了還是會再瞄一眼，看他是不是真的睡著。\n今天也辛苦了。去睡吧。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep01_s3.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-16-noon-gift-shipping",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-16T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "朋友家添了寶寶，禮物想直接寄過去。\n可以寄到朋友家，也可以寄到月子中心，不用先轉寄一次。\n結帳時勾選「這是送禮，寄給別人」，收件欄填收禮人的姓名、手機和地址；寄月子中心，備註再寫中心名稱、媽媽的姓名、房號和收件時間。\n祝福卡也可以把想說的話寫上。建議選宅配到府，超商取貨付款要由收禮人付款。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-17-evening-sweat-pad",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-17T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "跑跳、玩積木，一忙起來就流汗。\n把替換巾從後領放入，攤平在衣服和背部之間，小領片翻在衣領外；濕了就抽出來，換一條乾淨的。\n請在孩子清醒、由大人看顧時使用，睡覺前取下，布巾不要遮住口鼻，也不留在嬰兒睡眠空間。\n不放背後時，也可以拿來擦汗，或墊在大人肩上拍嗝；背部、擦嘴和拍嗝，請分開用乾淨的布巾。\n現售花色有粉色自由鳥，其他款式請看選購區。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-sweat-pad?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-18-noon-journal-yilan",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-18T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "那趟宜蘭的雨，沒有把行程整段取消。\n蠟筆城堡裡畫彩色筆，晚上回到蘭城晶英，還有小車和房內帳篷可以玩。\n雨天帶小孩出門，本來就會慢一些；能進到室內、再走一段，也就夠了。\n這篇遊記還在喜福生活誌裡，想翻照片的時候可以看。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/journals/hibou-travel-yilan?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-19-evening-swaddle-towel",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-19T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "一條方巾，包著、擦著、蓋著。\n約 70 公分見方，一面是紗布，一面是圈圈毛巾布。包的時候毛巾面朝裡，腿要留可以彎、可以張開的空間，布不要蓋到口鼻。\n寶寶開始會翻身、或常常想掙脫時，就不要再包，改當浴巾，或推車上的小蓋毯。\n擦乾、換好衣服以後就收起來，不要留在嬰兒睡眠空間。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-swaddle-towel?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-20-noon-gauze-washing",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "洗澡台邊一條、擦嘴一條，外出包再留乾淨的備品。\n紗布巾先分好用途，用過的和乾淨的分開放，不要把沾濕的布折回乾淨那一格。\n第一次用以前，先依洗標洗過、晾乾；能不能機洗、要不要洗衣袋，都看那一件的說明。\n洗完整條乾透再收。包邊鬆了、或洗完還有異味，先停用，問我們就好。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-gauze-washing?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-21-evening-owl-ep03-s2",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-21T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "一句「辛苦了」，也是一份彌月祝福。\n寶寶來了，半夜要起床的人多了一個。\n禮物不必只買給寶寶。卡片寫給他們：這陣子誰在熬夜、誰在換尿布。\n蘋安彌月禮盒可以加祝福卡，下單時把話寫進去。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep03_s2.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-22-noon-giftbox-choice",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-22T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "送彌月禮，不必先決定要哪一盒。\n可以先問：家裡還缺什麼？有衣服或防踢被，再問身高和現在的尺寸；想繡名字，先把寫法問清楚。\n官網上有蘋安彌月禮盒、神隊友滿月彌月禮盒，還有新生彌月日式連身褲禮盒，三款內容不一樣，分開看就好。\n先選用得到的，再看好花色。\n有送禮日的話，先用 LINE 問我們。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-23-evening-owl-ep02-s1",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-23T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "天氣轉涼，出門前多做一個小檢查。\n先固定，再整理下擺，最後看看寶寶的臉。\n防風罩不能取代推車安全帶，也不能遮住口鼻；下擺還要避開輪子與關節。\n你家出門前，一定會檢查哪一件事？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep02_s1.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "帶娃出門崩潰日記",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-windshield-usage?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-24-noon-winter-warmth",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-24T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "防風和保暖，其實不是同一件事。\n風大的時候，就算氣溫沒那麼低，直吹也會覺得冷；進到室內、天氣回暖，這一層也許就不需要了。\n防風罩減少風吹在身上，它本身不是厚的保暖層；覺得熱了、寶寶出汗了，就打開或取下。臉和口鼻要露出來，外出時大人在旁邊看顧。\n表布防潑水，也不等於雨具。下雨還是先找地方避雨。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/guides/stroller-winter-warmth?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-25-evening-bib-round",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-25T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "衣領一下就濕了，外出包再放一條乾淨的圍兜。\n６重紗圓形圍兜用按扣圍在胸前，下擺是一片圓弧；沾濕時就能替換，衣服濕了也要一起換。\n由大人協助扣合，扣好後看頸部鬆緊，布不要堆到口鼻旁；睡覺前取下。\n單入販售，現售花色請看選購區。\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-bib-round?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-26-noon-owl-ep03-s3",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-26T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "禮盒一打開，大家各看各的。\n有人看花色，有人研究紗布巾，有人急著唸卡片。\n花色可以等，卡片上那幾句先唸完。\n你收過哪一句彌月祝福，到現在還記得？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep03_s3.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/guides/baby-gift-budget-timing?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-13T22:34:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-27-evening-owl-ep02-s2",
    "slot": "evening",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-27T20:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "風大的日子，也想帶你慢慢走。\n不必趕路，也不用把小被子一路追著跑。\n先照推車或揹巾的說明扣上，不要拆掉原本的固定。\n路上看：臉露出來、口鼻沒被蓋住、扣子有沒有鬆。熱了就打開。",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/videos/2026/owl_shorts/ep02_s2.mp4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-windshield?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=threads_nov_20261116"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "threads_drafts_20261116_1129",
    "status": "approved",
